  message: "See WI-ninar for the full proposal and the four-site consumer audit; these two ship as one PR because neither is safe to land alone. This item's specific half: ci_verdict_permits_merge as a chokepoint, replacing four hand-rolled enumerate-the-blocking-codes chains, two of which fall through to merge on exit 3 TODAY (merge-pr:297 and auto-pr:2065, the post-rebase merge path). Awaiting governance approval - scripts/merge-pr, scripts/auto-pr and scripts/lib/forgejo-api.sh are all governance files."  # 8084
